OL,3,GNEWSARyanair boss Michael O'Leary
OL,4,Aapologises over 'high-fare rapists'
OL,5,Aremarks
OL,6,
OL,7,FRyanair chief executive Michael O'Leary
OL,8,Fhas said he is "truly sorry" for
OL,9,Fdescribing rival airlines as "high-fare
OL,10,Frapists".
OL,12,FHe had previously refused to apologise
OL,13,Fto a rape crisis centre which
OL,14,Fcriticised him for the comments.
OL,16,FO'Leary had made the remark earlier
OL,17,Fthis month while talking to journalists
OL,18,Fahead of Ryanair's yearly meeting with
OL,19,Fshareholders.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
