OL,3,GNEWSARyanair boss Michael O'Leary
OL,4,Aapologises over 'high-fare rapists'
OL,5,Aremarks
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing the comments, the Dublin Rape
OL,8,FCrisis Centre (DRCC) wrote to him
OL,9,Fasking for an apology, in a letter seen
OL,10,Fby the BBC.
